<http://purl.org/tara/ontology/kb/articles-kb.ttl> rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
                                                    dc:creator "Fahim T. Imam, PhD - https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4752-543X" ;
                                                    dc:date "August 30, 2026" ;
                                                    dc:title "TARA Articles Knowledge Base"@en ;
                                                    dcterms:description """This ontology includes TARA Clinical Trials Knowledgebase - a structured metadata knowledgebase for acupuncture clinical trial studies developed as part of the TARA Acupoints Research project, encompassing randomized controlled trials, meta-analyses, and systematic reviews of clinical trials. The knowledgebase is derived from metadata extracted from full-text journal publications and is intended to support systematic retrieval, comparison, and quality assessment of acupuncture research studies.

Metadata for each publication instance is captured through a standard set of annotation properties organized into three categories:
- Bibliographic Metadata: article title, authorship, source, and publication identifiers
- Study Metadata: intervention design, participant characteristics, sample size, outcome measures, and study outcomes
- OCSI Score Assessment Metadata: compliance with OCSI criteria for evaluating the completeness and quality of acupuncture trial reporting"""@en ;
																										
